# The cases of faults_registry.anti: a name and the value of ANTI_FAULT,
# see tests/CMakeLists.txt. The runtime takes the first four allocations
# at the start of the program, and reflect.new the fifth. deserialize
# takes the list of its objects with the sixth, the list of its blocks
# with the seventh, the object from LibcAllocator with the eighth and the
# bits of the fields with the ninth. T139: memory that runs out in the
# runtime there gives none, where the program must stop. An allocator
# that gives none makes deserialize give none.
object_memory alloc:5:ENOMEM
objects_memory alloc:6:ENOMEM
blocks_memory alloc:7:ENOMEM
allocator_none alloc:8:ENOMEM
fields_memory alloc:9:ENOMEM
